  "body": "Currently IETF links point to `tools.ietf.org` instead of `datatracker.ietf.org`. `tools.ietf.org` was [migrated](https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/msg/ietf-announce/xKzJZIyanPCclTd7DU9PxBAbwhA/\r\nhttps://github.com/ietf-tools/tools-transition-plan) to `datatracker`, so it would be a good chore to move those links to use `datatracker` directly rather than rely on a redirect.",
